UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d2-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270104T233000Z
DTEND:20270105T013000Z
SUMMARY:珍珠港航空博物馆
DESCRIPTION:两个机库，约1.5小时。看完坐接驳车回游客中心
 。\n\nPassport to Pearl Harbor: https://www.pearlharborhistoricsites.org/
 tickets\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pear
 l%20Harbor%20Aviation%20Museum
LOCATION:Pearl Harbor Aviation Museum
GEO:21.3588442;-157.9629042
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Pearl Har
 bor Aviation Museum":geo:21.3588442,-157.9629042
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d2-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270105T013000Z
DTEND:20270105T023000Z
SUMMARY:回Waikīkī
DESCRIPTION:航空博物馆看完坐接驳车回游客中心，Uber约25分
 钟，16:00左右到。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search
 /?api=1&query=Hotel%20Renew%2C%20129%20Paoakalani%20Ave%2C%20Honolulu
LOCATION:Hotel Renew\, 129 Paoakalani Ave\, Honolulu
GEO:21.2727845;-157.8222219
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Ren
 ew, 129 Paoakalani Ave, Honolulu":geo:21.2727845,-157.8222219
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d2-7@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270105T023000Z
DTEND:20270105T050000Z
SUMMARY:备选：Waikīkī 日落帆船
DESCRIPTION:日落帆船可以安排在今天或1/7，看出发前的天气
 和海况，哪天风浪小、云少就选哪天。选今天的话，16:30
 到海滩上船点，17:00–19:00出海；时差刚倒，累的话就留
 给1/7。不坐船就在Kūhiō Beach散步看日落（1月约18:05）。\
 n\nMoana Sailing 订票: https://www.hawaiiactivities.com/en/hawaii/oahu/a
 /166886\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=K%C5
 %ABhi%C5%8D%20Beach%2C%20Honolulu
LOCATION:Kūhiō Beach\, Honolulu
GEO:21.275;-157.82694
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Kūhiō B
 each, Honolulu":geo:21.275,-157.82694
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d2-8@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270105T043000Z
DTEND:20270105T053000Z
SUMMARY:晚餐：Duke's Waikiki
DESCRIPTION:海边餐厅，吃鱼和Hula Pie，建议提前订位；今天
 坐日落帆船的话，订19:15。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com
 /maps/search/?api=1&query=Duke's%20Waikiki
LOCATION:Duke's Waikiki
GEO:21.2768421;-157.8277917
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Duke's Wa
 ikiki":geo:21.2768421,-157.8277917
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270105T181500Z
DTEND:20270105T190000Z
SUMMARY:Waikīkī取车
DESCRIPTION:带上G牌驾照和信用卡，检查车况并拍照。今天
 顺时针绕岛：先去东北边的山谷，再沿北岸回来。\n\nGoog
 le Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Waik%C4%ABk%C4%AB
 %E7%A7%9F%E8%BD%A6%E9%97%A8%E5%BA%97%EF%BC%88%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E4%BD%8D%E
 7%BD%AE%EF%BC%89
LOCATION:Waikīkī租车门店（示例位置）
GEO:21.2734513;-157.8222713
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Waikīkī
 租车门店（示例位置）":geo:21.2734513,-157.8222713
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270105T190000Z
DTEND:20270105T200500Z
SUMMARY:Hoʻomaluhia 植物园
DESCRIPTION:9:00开门。开车进园，在湖边停车拍山，下车走
 一小段。这次不去平等院，所以这里可以多待一会儿。\n
 \nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ho%CA%BBoma
 luhia%20Botanical%20Garden
LOCATION:Hoʻomaluhia Botanical Garden
GEO:21.3882747;-157.8070148
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hoʻomalu
 hia Botanical Garden":geo:21.3882747,-157.8070148
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270105T210000Z
DTEND:20270105T233000Z
SUMMARY:古兰尼牧场 Jurassic Adventure
DESCRIPTION:10:40左右到牧场签到。坐越野车进Kualoa、Hakipuʻu
 、Kaʻaʻawa三条山谷，看《侏罗纪公园》《侏罗纪世界》
 等拍摄地。路面颠簸，只有短距离步行。场次要提前订
 。\n\nKualoa官方: https://www.kualoa.com/tours/\nGoogle Maps: https://w
 ww.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kualoa%20Ranch
LOCATION:Kualoa Ranch
GEO:21.5208318;-157.8372577
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Kualoa Ra
 nch":geo:21.5208318,-157.8372577
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T000500Z
DTEND:20270106T004000Z
SUMMARY:Giovanni's 蒜蓉虾饭
DESCRIPTION:午餐。排队太长就换旁边的Romy's或Fumi's。之后沿
 Kamehameha Hwy往西开，经过鲨鱼湾和威美亚湾时在车上看一
 眼就好：冬天下午北岸浪大，不专门停。\n\nGoogle Maps: htt
 ps://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Giovanni's%20Shrimp%20Truck%2
 C%20Kahuku
LOCATION:Giovanni's Shrimp Truck\, Kahuku
GEO:21.677198;-157.9484211
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Giovanni'
 s Shrimp Truck, Kahuku":geo:21.677198,-157.9484211
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T010500Z
DTEND:20270106T012000Z
SUMMARY:Laniakea 看海龟
DESCRIPTION:下午常有海龟上岸晒太阳，在岸边看15分钟，保
 持距离。路边停车紧，找不到车位就直接去菠萝园。\n\nG
 oogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Laniakea%20Bea
 ch
LOCATION:Laniakea Beach
GEO:21.6187;-158.0853
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Laniakea 
 Beach":geo:21.6187,-158.0853
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T014000Z
DTEND:20270106T033000Z
SUMMARY:Dole Plantation：小火车 + 迷宫
DESCRIPTION:先坐Pineapple Express小火车（约20分钟，大约每10分
 钟一班；官方建议连菠萝切片表演留1小时），再走Pineapp
 le Garden Maze（平均40分钟），最后吃Dole Whip。全园9:30–17:
 30，末班车和迷宫最后入场时间官网没写，出发前打电话
 808-621-8408确认；如果末班较早，就先走迷宫。\n\nDole Plant
 ation官方: https://www.doleplantation.com/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.goo
 gle.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dole%20Plantation
LOCATION:Dole Plantation
GEO:21.5259081;-158.0378039
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Dole Plan
 tation":geo:21.5259081,-158.0378039
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T035000Z
DTEND:20270106T044000Z
SUMMARY:Waikele Premium Outlets 奥莱
DESCRIPTION:从菠萝园沿H-2开约20分钟。只逛50分钟左右；在
 菠萝园玩得晚，就跳过，直接去Ko Olina吃晚饭。\n\n奥莱
 官方: https://www.premiumoutlets.com/outlet/waikele\nGoogle Maps: https:
 //www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Waikele%20Premium%20Outlets
LOCATION:Waikele Premium Outlets
GEO:21.4017617;-158.0068567
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Waikele P
 remium Outlets":geo:21.4017617,-158.0068567
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-7@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T050000Z
DTEND:20270106T055000Z
SUMMARY:Ko Olina 晚餐
DESCRIPTION:从奥莱开约18分钟（从菠萝园直接过去约35分钟
 ）。在Ko Olina度假区里吃，例如 Monkeypod Kitchen，建议订位
 。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Four%2
 0Seasons%20Resort%20Oahu%20at%20Ko%20Olina
LOCATION:Four Seasons Resort Oahu at Ko Olina
GEO:21.3392955;-158.125741
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Four Seas
 ons Resort Oahu at Ko Olina":geo:21.3392955,-158.125741
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-8@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T060000Z
DTEND:20270106T070000Z
SUMMARY:星空讲解 · Stars Above Hawaii
DESCRIPTION:天文讲解员带电脑望远镜，讲夏威夷星空导航，
 约1小时，照片会发到手机。1/7是新月，这几天月光最暗
 。开场时间按订到的场次为准，当天下午会发短信说明
 天气和观测位置；因天气取消可全额退款或改期。\n\n订
 票页: https://www.greetwell.com/us/direct/stargazing-star-show-ko-olina-
 resort\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Four%
 20Seasons%20Resort%20Oahu%20at%20Ko%20Olina
LOCATION:Four Seasons Resort Oahu at Ko Olina
GEO:21.3392955;-158.125741
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Four Seas
 ons Resort Oahu at Ko Olina":geo:21.3392955,-158.125741
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d3-9@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T070000Z
DTEND:20270106T080000Z
SUMMARY:开回Waikīkī
DESCRIPTION:约45分钟，21:45左右到酒店。夜路慢一点；今天
 是很长的一天。车停酒店过夜（约USD45），明早还车。\n\
 nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel%20Rene
 w%2C%20129%20Paoakalani%20Ave%2C%20Honolulu
LOCATION:Hotel Renew\, 129 Paoakalani Ave\, Honolulu
GEO:21.2727845;-157.8222219
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Ren
 ew, 129 Paoakalani Ave, Honolulu":geo:21.2727845,-157.8222219
END:VEVENT
