DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T190000Z
DTEND:20270106T200000Z
SUMMARY:启用Waikiki Trolley四日票
DESCRIPTION:四日全线票两人约USD150，可以随上随下，1/6到1/8
 都用它。坐红线（市区历史线）去王宫。\n\nWaikiki Trolley
 官方: https://waikikitrolley.com/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/m
 aps/search/?api=1&query=T%20Galleria%20by%20DFS%2C%20Waikiki
LOCATION:T Galleria by DFS\, Waikiki
