DTSTAMP:20261119T191352Z
DTSTART:20270106T200000Z
DTEND:20270106T213000Z
SUMMARY:ʻIolani Palace 王宫
DESCRIPTION:美国唯一的王宫，周二至周六开放，只能网上买
 票。\n\nʻIolani Palace官方: https://www.iolanipalace.org/visit/\nGoog
 le Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%CA%BBIolani%20Pa
 lace
LOCATION:ʻIolani Palace
GEO:21.3068147;-157.8587655
