SUMMARY:坐绿线去钻石山观景台
DESCRIPTION:绿线（Diamond Head Line）在Kahala Lookout有拍照停靠
 ，下车就能看到钻石山和海，不用走路爬山。绿线一圈
 约70分钟，下午最后一班约15:10–15:40从钻石山一带返回
 ，别太晚出发。不进火山口：进火山口要另外预约州立
 公园门票，而且不登顶也没什么可看。\n\n绿线时刻和站
 点: https://waikikitrolley.com/green-line/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Diamond%20Head%20Lookout%2C%20Diamond%20He
 ad%20Rd%2C%20Honolulu
LOCATION:Diamond Head Lookout\, Diamond Head Rd\, Honolulu
GEO:21.2557;-157.807
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Diamond H
 ead Lookout, Diamond Head Rd, Honolulu":geo:21.2557,-157.807
END:VEVENT
